  Hi,

I would like to draw your attention to a possible violation of the
GNU license. There is a German shareware game named GOR which is probably
derived from Nethack code. Especially the game commands and messages
are direct translations from Nethack ones, as well as the object types
and behaviours and the character stats, though the 3D look and the
generated levels are somewhat different and there is only one character
type.

Could the Dev Team or someone from GNU comment on a case like this?
I'm willing to mail a sample of the demo version if I'm asked to,
but only one or two, since I have to pay for every K of mail.

